      "adaptation": "Add four optional public metadata columns (public_notes, site_key, site_url, image_url), an explicit migrate_public_columns()/migrate-public path, optional CSV columns and NULL-for-blank storage; private contact columns untouched. Add nullable public_links JSON-text column, migrate it with migrate-public, read it from CSV, and add an export subcommand writing public columns to CSV."
