      "destination_sha256": "674161ec386b5b38c5a7f458438903a7957d492628b280aa4347994160c99d50",
      "adaptation": "Change new-output brand and printable contact website defaults to b.tc4fun.ir; retain existing operator config and email. Add optional public metadata config keys with https/host validation and pass them to the database row. Add serial_minsec mode 'short': 5-char stem Y(1,base36)+M+D+H+X(1,base36) with a per-hour counter derived from existing batch_* folders (no DB); digits/compact modes retained. Require site_url's host to match site_key (the site's name) so the public pair is a key/value of name and address. Add optional public_links key/value map (instagram, telegram, ...) validated as https URLs and stored with each row. Add opt-in Regency Method-3 full-A4 envelopes with secrets on inward face, duplex public backs and public account companions. Add opt-in card-sized Regency envelopes (regency_card): two 171.2 x 148 mm leaves per A4, sealed packet 85.6 x 54 mm with a 12 mm wax-seal tab, secrets on the inward face and the public address QR plus warning on the back. Replace the card-sized envelope's fold instructions with cold-storage guidance and the https://b.tc4fun.ir/security link, encode the recovery words as a QR beside the printed list, and draw the cut border solid with hatched fold creases, replace the seal-tab caption with a small vector Bitcoin mark, and move the printable contact mailbox to b.tc4fun.ir."
    },
